#: PART3.md:1
msgid "Part 3: Use the bias on a system with multiple ions"
msgstr "Part 3：複数の Ion を持つ系への Bias の適用"

#: PART3.md:3
msgid ""
"Now that our bias is tested for a single Mg<sup>2+</sup>–phosphate pair, we "
"can use it on a larger RNA system with multiple binding sites and ions in "
"solution."
msgstr ""
"単一の Mg<sup>2+</sup>–Phosphate Pair で Bias をテストできたので、複数の結合部位と溶液中の Ion を持つ大きな "
"RNA 系に適用します。"

#: PART3.md:5
msgid ""
"We will directly use the accelerating stategy to sample the Mg-binding "
"features of a short RNA duplex, G<sub>3</sub>·C<sub>3</sub>."
msgstr ""
"この加速法を直接使い、短い RNA Duplex G<sub>3</sub>·C<sub>3</sub> の Mg 結合特性を Sampling "
"します。"

#: PART3.md:6
msgid "Implementation"
msgstr "実装"

#: PART3.md:8
msgid "Simulation set-up"
msgstr "シミュレーションの設定"

#: PART3.md:12
msgid "We provide as input files:"
msgstr "次の入力ファイルを用意しています。"

#: PART3.md:13
msgid ""
"`input.gro`: equilibrated simulation box with the "
"G<sub>3</sub>·C<sub>3</sub> duplex solvated with MgCl<sub>2</sub> (8 "
"Mg<sup>2+</sup> and 10 Cl<sup>−</sup> ions in total)"
msgstr ""
"`input.gro`：MgCl<sub>2</sub> 溶液中の G<sub>3</sub>·C<sub>3</sub> Duplex "
"を含む平衡化済み Box（Mg<sup>2+</sup> 8個、Cl<sup>−</sup> 10個）"

#: PART3.md:14
msgid "`run.mdp`: GROMACS MD parameter file"
msgstr "`run.mdp`：GROMACS の MD パラメータファイル"

#: PART3.md:15
msgid "`topol.top`: Standalone GROMACS topology file"
msgstr "`topol.top`：単独で使える GROMACS Topology"

#: PART3.md:17
msgid "[They can be downloaded here.](duplex/duplex.zip)"
msgstr "[こちらからダウンロードできます。](duplex/duplex.zip)"

#: PART3.md:20
msgid "Instructions"
msgstr "演習の手順"

#: PART3.md:22
msgid ""
"Write a PLUMED input file `plumed_duplex.dat`. You will need to declare two "
"coordination CVs and one bias for every Mg atom."
msgstr ""
"PLUMED 入力 `plumed_duplex.dat` を作成してください。各 Mg 原子に対して2つの Coordination CV と1つの "
"Bias を宣言します。"

#: PART3.md:24
msgid ""
"[!TIP] This is probably better done with a script. One way of doing this in "
"a bash script is to first get a list of indices for all MG atoms, for "
"example using [AWK](https://www.gnu.org/software/gawk/manual/gawk.html):"
msgstr ""
"[!TIP] スクリプトを使う方がよいでしょう。Bash では、例えば "
"[AWK](https://www.gnu.org/software/gawk/manual/gawk.html) で、まず全 MG 原子の Index"
" の一覧を得ます。"

#: PART3.md:29
msgid "and then generate the PLUMED code in a `for` loop"
msgstr "次に `for` Loop 内で PLUMED コードを生成します。"
